        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBR1051H, 10-3/8\" Dual Level Wire Basket With Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe attached hook on this rectangular wire basket is perfect for hanging a loofa while the basket itself is great for holding anything from body wash to shampoo; but the the Deltana made WBR1051H Wire Shelf is the perfect solution to your storage needs both inside the bathroom and without. It is designed to be mounted easily to the wall. Constructed out of solid brass, it is available in oil rubbed bronze, polished nickel, satin nickel, polished chrome, and pvd polished brass finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR1051H.gif?v=1704354770\" width=\"494\" height=\"332\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBR1051H 10-3/8\"Combination Level Wire Basket With Hook  Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBR1051H Two Level Solid Brass Rectangular Basket With Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth (highest level): 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth (lowest level) 2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR1051H.pdf?v=1704262293\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBR1051H 10-3/8\" Combination Level Wire Basket With Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
